      "line_number": 11,
      "target_phrase": "cambronne",
      "annotation_text": "A veiled reference to General Cambronne's famous response 'Merde!' at Waterloo. In the Wake, this becomes part of the thunderous collapse of order, bringing the high-flown military rhetoric down to the scatalogical.",
